WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:32.458
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna told us

2
00:00:32.458 --> 00:00:35.375
that He is the foundation of 
creation, sustenance,

3
00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:38.583
and dissolution of all of existence.

4
00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:40.416
Yet He remains completely free

5
00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:42.250
from all material actions

6
00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.791
and their results.

7
00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:45.666
Hearing this,

8
00:00:45.666 --> 00:00:47.750
a question may have arisen –

9
00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:49.666
how is this possible?

10
00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:52.208
How can one act and yet remain

11
00:00:52.208 --> 00:00:54.416
unattached to the fruits of those actions?

12
00:00:54.416 --> 00:00:57.041


13
00:00:57.041 --> 00:01:01.416
In this verse, Lord Krishna
 answers this question in detail.

14
00:01:06.291 --> 00:01:09.333
Lord Krishna clearly states in this verse –

15
00:01:09.333 --> 00:01:12.500
although He is at the centre
of all creation, sustenance,

16
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:14.375
and dissolution,

17
00:01:14.375 --> 00:01:18.125
He is not bound by any action.

18
00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:21.416
He keeps Himself free

19
00:01:21.416 --> 00:01:24.291
from attachment to the fruits of action.

20
00:01:24.291 --> 00:01:25.250
Human beings, on the other hand,

21
00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:26.458
get caught in the joy and sorrow

22
00:01:26.458 --> 00:01:28.291
born of their actions,

23
00:01:28.291 --> 00:01:31.791
because they are attached to results.

24
00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.833
And this cycle of chasing outcomes

25
00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:37.583
cannot give them lasting peace.

26
00:01:37.583 --> 00:01:38.875
But Lord Krishna

27
00:01:38.875 --> 00:01:41.875
remains completely detached from this cycle.

28
00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:44.166
He is like a judge

29
00:01:44.166 --> 00:01:45.583
who watches the proceedings

30
00:01:45.583 --> 00:01:48.000
of a court with impartiality,

31
00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.166
without becoming emotionally involved.

32
00:01:51.166 --> 00:01:52.166
In the same way,

33
00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:52.791
Lord Krishna

34
00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:55.250
witnesses this world with equanimity.

35
00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:56.750
And this entire world operates

36
00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:58.250
according to the laws of karma

37
00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:01.375
established by Him.

38
00:02:01.375 --> 00:02:02.458
Every being

39
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:04.583
experiences joy and sorrow

40
00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:06.333
based on their past actions –

41
00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:09.916
not by any personal wish of Lord Krishna.

42
00:02:09.916 --> 00:02:13.916
Just as the sun shines equally on all,

43
00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:16.416
yet some receive shade

44
00:02:16.416 --> 00:02:17.750
and some receive sunlight –

45
00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:20.041
Lord Krishna gives every being opportunities

46
00:02:20.041 --> 00:02:23.291
according to their past karma.

47
00:02:23.291 --> 00:02:25.666
But their present actions

48
00:02:25.666 --> 00:02:27.791
are what determine their future.

49
00:02:27.791 --> 00:02:31.416
And this is the cause of a
 person’s joy and sorrow.

50
00:02:31.416 --> 00:02:33.583
This detachment of Lord Krishna

51
00:02:33.583 --> 00:02:36.958
is proof of His supreme spiritual nature.

52
00:02:36.958 --> 00:02:39.958
Unlike humans, He is not driven by

53
00:02:39.958 --> 00:02:42.625
personal desire or ambition.

54
00:02:42.625 --> 00:02:44.458
He expects no fruit for Himself.

55
00:02:44.458 --> 00:02:46.166
Whatever He does,

56
00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:49.250
He does only for the good of creation.

57
00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:51.791
And because of this desireless action,

58
00:02:51.791 --> 00:02:53.333
He remains free

59
00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:56.041
from all karmic bondage.

60
00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:58.625
This verse teaches us

61
00:02:58.625 --> 00:03:01.416
that we too should perform our
 duties with full sincerity,

62
00:03:01.416 --> 00:03:04.666
free from attachment to results.

63
00:03:04.666 --> 00:03:05.541
This attitude

64
00:03:05.541 --> 00:03:08.250
can free us from the bondage of karma

65
00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.833
and allow us to progress steadily

66
00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:13.208
on our spiritual journey.

67
00:03:17.541 --> 00:03:22.000
Whenever you place expectations 
on other people

68
00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:26.000
or situations in life,

69
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:31.916
your emotional world is thrown into turmoil.

70
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:38.666
Life flows like a wave on water –

71
00:03:38.666 --> 00:03:42.000
sometimes up, sometimes down.

72
00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:47.833
The more attached you are
to people or situations,

73
00:03:47.833 --> 00:03:49.041
the more

74
00:03:49.041 --> 00:03:53.541
their ups and downs affect you.

75
00:03:53.541 --> 00:03:57.791
When things go against your expectations,

76
00:03:57.791 --> 00:04:01.291
you sink into an ocean of sorrow.

77
00:04:01.291 --> 00:04:06.250
And when everything goes as planned,

78
00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:08.958
you float in momentary joy.

79
00:04:08.958 --> 00:04:10.916
But

80
00:04:10.916 --> 00:04:12.958
how long will you stay

81
00:04:12.958 --> 00:04:16.291
trapped in this cycle?

82
00:04:16.291 --> 00:04:21.041
Shall I show you another way –

83
00:04:21.041 --> 00:04:22.708
a path

84
00:04:22.708 --> 00:04:25.541
where you love deeply,

85
00:04:25.541 --> 00:04:28.500
yet are not caught in bondage?

86
00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:33.083
Do you want to understand such path?

87
00:04:33.083 --> 00:04:34.875
Let me explain. 

88
00:04:34.875 --> 00:04:37.541
Whenever you do something,

89
00:04:37.541 --> 00:04:42.000
do not expect a particular outcome from it.

90
00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.583
Love whomever you love –

91
00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:49.000
do so selflessly, without expectation.

92
00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:53.708
When you become free from
 attachment to outcomes,

93
00:04:53.708 --> 00:04:57.750
you will also become free

94
00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:00.000
from the cycle of joy and sorrow in life.

95
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.083
Now detachment does not mean

96
00:05:04.083 --> 00:05:06.750
becoming emotionless

97
00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:09.958
or abandoning your duties.

98
00:05:09.958 --> 00:05:13.708
It means loving others,

99
00:05:13.708 --> 00:05:16.000
but without the expectation that

100
00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.250
they must behave as you wish.

101
00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:22.500
When you love without selfishness
 and expectation,

102
00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:27.500
your love becomes pure and powerful.

103
00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:32.125
I sustain the entire universe,

104
00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:36.291
yet I am not bound by any result.

105
00:05:36.291 --> 00:05:38.833
You too can do the same –

106
00:05:38.833 --> 00:05:41.291
live with full dedication,

107
00:05:41.291 --> 00:05:43.666
but do not let outcomes

108
00:05:43.666 --> 00:05:46.166
disturb your inner peace.

109
00:05:46.166 --> 00:05:48.375
When you embrace this way of being,

110
00:05:48.375 --> 00:05:50.291
you will find steadiness

111
00:05:50.291 --> 00:05:52.625
even through the ups and downs of life –

112
00:05:52.625 --> 00:05:55.208
and a divine peace as well.

113
00:05:55.208 --> 00:05:57.375
Think about this.

114
00:06:02.041 --> 00:06:04.000
Attachment

115
00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:08.333
always holds back growth.

116
00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:10.583
I know

117
00:06:10.583 --> 00:06:15.250
you love your family deeply

118
00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:21.291
and are always ready to do everything for them.

119
00:06:21.291 --> 00:06:23.458
But

120
00:06:23.458 --> 00:06:26.166
do you believe

121
00:06:26.166 --> 00:06:30.000
that you alone can fix everything?

122
00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:34.208
If you think so, pause.

123
00:06:34.208 --> 00:06:41.083
This thinking will only create unrest within you.

124
00:06:41.083 --> 00:06:43.416
The circumstances your loved ones are in

125
00:06:43.416 --> 00:06:47.625
are the fruit of their own actions.

126
00:06:47.625 --> 00:06:52.000
You can be concerned for them –

127
00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.375
but concern does not mean

128
00:06:54.375 --> 00:06:58.791
being shaken by their every situation.

129
00:06:58.791 --> 00:07:00.583
Just as

130
00:07:00.583 --> 00:07:04.500
I govern all of creation

131
00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:10.500
yet remain calm and detached –

132
00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:14.166
adopt this same attitude.

133
00:07:14.166 --> 00:07:17.000
Serve your family with love,

134
00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.125
but do not attach yourself so deeply

135
00:07:20.125 --> 00:07:23.625
to their circumstances

136
00:07:23.625 --> 00:07:24.583
that your own

137
00:07:24.583 --> 00:07:28.375
inner peace and balance is lost.

138
00:07:28.375 --> 00:07:30.875
When your loved one

139
00:07:30.875 --> 00:07:34.041
is facing difficulties,

140
00:07:34.041 --> 00:07:36.083
offer them support.

141
00:07:36.083 --> 00:07:40.583
But do not take on their sorrow so completely

142
00:07:40.583 --> 00:07:44.541
that it drains your own strength.

143
00:07:44.541 --> 00:07:46.708
Your duty is

144
00:07:46.708 --> 00:07:51.208
to lovingly guide, inspire,

145
00:07:51.208 --> 00:07:55.416
and support them – not to drown in worry.

146
00:07:55.416 --> 00:07:59.125
When you see your family with this perspective,

147
00:07:59.125 --> 00:08:04.333
you infuse a new strength in them too.

148
00:08:04.333 --> 00:08:07.583
They are inspired by your patience,

149
00:08:07.583 --> 00:08:10.583
your steadiness, and your love.

150
00:08:10.583 --> 00:08:13.125
And this is

151
00:08:13.125 --> 00:08:17.791
the path to happiness and peace –
for you and for them.

152
00:08:22.208 --> 00:08:24.750
Have you ever wondered

153
00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:29.291
where stress at the workplace is born?

154
00:08:29.291 --> 00:08:36.291
Stress is born where you try to control situations

155
00:08:36.291 --> 00:08:38.375
that are not in your hands.

156
00:08:38.375 --> 00:08:42.333
Remember, only your action is in your hands.

157
00:08:42.333 --> 00:08:44.000
Not the result.

158
00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:47.791
Simply do your work wholeheartedly,

159
00:08:47.791 --> 00:08:50.458
and free yourself from the worry

160
00:08:50.458 --> 00:08:52.166
of what people will say

161
00:08:52.166 --> 00:08:54.458
or what the outcome will be.

162
00:08:54.458 --> 00:08:55.916
I govern

163
00:08:55.916 --> 00:09:00.250
all of creation,

164
00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:01.750
yet I am

165
00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:06.750
not bound by any result.

166
00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:09.500
I am free –

167
00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.250
because

168
00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:13.000
I am detached.

169
00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.125
Adopt this same attitude.

170
00:09:16.125 --> 00:09:21.000
Let go of the fruit – focus on the action.

171
00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:24.500
When you work hard at something,

172
00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:27.583
give your very best

173
00:09:27.583 --> 00:09:30.750
to bring it to completion.

174
00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:33.166
But do not worry about its acceptance,

175
00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:36.541
its praise, or its outcome.

176
00:09:36.541 --> 00:09:40.250
When you accept this mindset,

177
00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:44.375
it will protect you from unnecessary stress,

178
00:09:44.375 --> 00:09:47.000
increase your efficiency,

179
00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:50.750
and you will experience joy in your work.

180
00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:54.666
And when you let go of anxiety over results,

181
00:09:54.666 --> 00:09:58.500
the work itself becomes excellent.

182
00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:01.916
And life becomes balanced, joyful,

183
00:10:01.916 --> 00:10:04.708
and successful.

184
00:10:04.708 --> 00:10:06.666
That’s why,

185
00:10:06.666 --> 00:10:08.708
Act -

186
00:10:08.708 --> 00:10:11.875
without worrying about the fruit.
